<mxCell id="lg_txt" value="&lt;b&gt;R&lt;/b&gt; = Reinforcing loop   &lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt; = Balancing loop   (+) same direction   (−) opposite direction   |   Circled letter = off-page connector (R = task returns to Client Tasks check, K1 = window config feeds kiosk, L-K / L-D = launcher starts Kiosk / Display, Q = forwarded task returns to queue)   |   D3, D2, D9, D10 appear more than once beside the processes that use them (same store)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="200" width="5100" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
