<mxCell id="e_E1" value="&lt;b&gt;E1  BIRTH REGISTRATION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Select Birth Registration&lt;br&gt;2. Collect birth registration info&lt;br&gt;3. Collect requester / registrant info&lt;br&gt;4. Record supporting docs / requirements&lt;br&gt;5. Validate required fields&lt;br&gt;6. Add to Client Tasks&lt;br&gt;7. Submit to Queue" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#67AB7E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2348" y="1000" width="288" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e_E2" value="&lt;b&gt;E2  MARRIAGE APPLICATION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Select Marriage Application&lt;br&gt;2. Collect applicant / spouse info&lt;br&gt;3. Record Sex + personal info&lt;br&gt;4. Record marriage application details&lt;br&gt;5. Record parental consent / advice info&lt;br&gt;6. Capture supporting information&lt;br&gt;7. Validate required fields&lt;br&gt;8. Add to Client Tasks&lt;br&gt;9. Submit to Queue" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#67AB7E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2648" y="1000" width="288" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e_E3" value="&lt;b&gt;E3  MARRIAGE REGISTRATION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Select Marriage Registration&lt;br&gt;2. Collect / reference marriage info&lt;br&gt;3. Create pending Marriage Registration task&lt;br&gt;4. Submit to Queue&lt;br&gt;(Form 97 capture + OCR happen in CROMS Main)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#67AB7E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2948" y="1000" width="288" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e_E4" value="&lt;b&gt;E4  DEATH REGISTRATION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Select Death Registration&lt;br&gt;2. Collect death registration / requester info&lt;br&gt;3. Record supporting requirements&lt;br&gt;4. Validate required fields&lt;br&gt;5. Add to Client Tasks&lt;br&gt;6. Submit to Queue" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#67AB7E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3248" y="1000" width="288" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e_E5" value="&lt;b&gt;E5  CERTIFICATE REQUEST / CPC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Select Certificate Request / CPC&lt;br&gt;2. Select requested civil registry document&lt;br&gt;3. Enter subject / record info&lt;br&gt;4. Enter copies / purpose (if applicable)&lt;br&gt;5. Enter requester information&lt;br&gt;6. Validate information&lt;br&gt;7. Add to Client Tasks&lt;br&gt;8. Submit to Queue" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#67AB7E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2348" y="1242" width="288" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e_E6" value="&lt;b&gt;E6  RELEASE &amp; CLAIM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Select Release &amp; Claim&lt;br&gt;2. Enter PREVIOUS queue no. / txn reference&lt;br&gt;3. Retrieve existing request — found?&lt;br&gt;NO: invalid notice; re-enter reference&lt;br&gt;YES: show request; verify claimant&lt;br&gt;6. Add Release &amp; Claim task&lt;br&gt;7. Submit to Queue&lt;br&gt;Previous Queue No. = Release &amp; Claim ONLY" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#67AB7E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2648" y="1242" width="288" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e_E7" value="&lt;b&gt;E7  PETITION / CASE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Select Petition / Case&lt;br&gt;2. Collect requester / petitioner info&lt;br&gt;3. Identify petition / case type&lt;br&gt;4. Record reference info + requirements&lt;br&gt;5. Add to Client Tasks&lt;br&gt;6. Submit to Queue" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#67AB7E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2948" y="1242" width="288" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e_E8" value="&lt;b&gt;E8  PSA BREQS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Select PSA BREQS&lt;br&gt;2. Select document type&lt;br&gt;3. Enter number of copies + purpose&lt;br&gt;4. Enter relationship to document owner&lt;br&gt;5. Enter valid ID information&lt;br&gt;6. Enter subject name&lt;br&gt;7. Enter date / place information&lt;br&gt;8. Validate&lt;br&gt;9. Add to Client Tasks&lt;br&gt;10. Submit to Queue" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#67AB7E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3248" y="1242" width="288" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
